<<include"Felix NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

<<if $FelixSocial > 50>>
    Felix Allard is your friend and classmate at Preston. He started at the same time as you, being a French foreign exchange student, and quickly managed to fit in and make some friends. Which makes sense, as the boy is smart, charming, and athletically gifted. You would be annoyed at how easy things seem to come to him, but it helps that he is very humble and friendly. You can’t help but find him a bit charming. <br>
    <br>
<<elseif $FelixSocial > -10>>
    Felix Allard is a French foreign exchange student to Preston Academy. He started at the same time as you and is generally a very friendly, if not a bit weird, boy. Despite his oddness, he seems to have become decently popular due to his charm and exotic flair. He is very smart and sporty, being very fond and skilled at the game of soccer, or as he calls it, football. <br>
    <br>
<<else>>
    Felix Allard is the annoying smart and frustratingly charming French foreign exchange student to Preston Academy. Despite his strangeness, he seems to have gotten pretty popular in a very short amount of time. This is just another thing on the list of reasons you dislike him. Things always come too easily to kids like him, and it’s super annoying! <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

<<if $CompletedQuests.includes("Felix: Mateo")>>
    Felix is living with a host family here, including a clingy little host brother named Mateo. Felix seems to have taken a liking to the boy, who seems to love his new big bro. <br>
    <br>
<</if>>

